$ grep -n 'examples' ~/.bashrc
$ grep -n examples /home/yxy/.bashrc
2:# see /usr/share/doc/bash/examples/startup-files (in the package bash-doc)
3:# for examples
102:# See /usr/share/doc/bash-doc/examples in the bash-doc package.
退出码=0 （0 表示找到匹配行）

